---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<PageLayout title="About" eyebrow="Our mission" description={`${SITE.name} helps players discover one interesting indie game from around the world every day.`}>
  <p class="lead">
    {SITE.name} exists for one reason: to help players discover interesting indie games from around the world, one game a day.
  </p>

  <p>
    Thousands of small games are released every year by solo developers, students and tiny studios. Many of them are wonderful, and most of them
    are never seen by the people who would love them. Store front pages reward big budgets. We'd rather reward good ideas.
  </p>

  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>One game a day.</strong> Each day we feature a single game, so it gets proper attention instead of being one tile in a wall of hundreds.</li>
    <li><strong>Play first.</strong> When a game has a browser version that the developer allows us to show, you can play it right here.</li>
    <li><strong>Official sources.</strong> Downloads point to the developer's own page or store listing. We only host a file ourselves when the developer has given us written permission.</li>
    <li><strong>Our own words.</strong> Game descriptions are written for {SITE.name}. We don't publish ratings, reviews or popularity numbers we haven't earned.</li>
    <li><strong>The archive stays.</strong> Every featured game remains in the <a href="/games/">archive</a>, searchable by title, genre and platform.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>For developers</h2>
  <p>
    Made something you'd like us to look at? Send us a link through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. Being featured is free. If we ever add
    paid placements, they will always be clearly labelled as sponsored and kept separate from our daily pick.
  </p>
  <p>If you'd like your game changed or removed from {SITE.name}, <a href="/report/">let us know</a> and we'll take care of it.</p>

  <h2>Keeping the lights on</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is a small, independent project. In the future we may add clearly marked advertising, affiliate links or sponsored features to cover
    hosting and time. The site will always be fully usable without them, and editorial picks will never be for sale.
  </p>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .lead {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }
</style>
